c=\"/graphics/q-134825-e-0\"></div>  \n\n<ul>\n<li>Statement III is false. Since the residuals are <em>not</em> randomly scattered above and below the horizontal axis, our regression line is <em>not</em> a good fit for the given data.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\"</p>\n</div>",
